id: senzu-farmer
name: Senzu Farmer
kind: gear
itemType: buddy
special: true
buddyKind: greater
original: any
grows: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Greater, of any ordinary Buddy: Adventuring, 1~4 Months for a Bag of Senzu Beans, a size
  larger for each Month after the first.
text: >
  Senzu Farmer: This special helper grows mystical Senzu Beans while you’re busy doing other
  things.
  –Special Buddy Type: Greater
  –Original Buddy: Any (chosen by the ARC ~ cannot be a Special Buddy)
  –Effects: While Adventuring, this Buddy may spend 1~4 Months growing Senzu Beans. Gain a Small
  Bag of Senzu Beans, but increase the size of the Senzu Beans bag by 1 for every month spent
  after the first.

---

# Grow Senzu, on its row while Adventuring: how many Months, and a Bag of Senzu Beans of that
# size - Small, Standard, Large, Extra Large - its Beans rolled as any Bag's are. The Months are
# the table's to pass.
